    "Its folder, including uncommitted changes, goes to the Trash, where you can restore it. Its branch and commits stay in the repository." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Son dossier, y compris les modifications non commitées, part dans la corbeille, d’où tu peux le restaurer. Sa branche et ses commits restent dans le dépôt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its terminals will be closed and its folder will be erased from disk, including uncommitted changes. This can’t be undone. The branch and its commits stay in the repository." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ses terminaux seront fermés et son dossier sera effacé du disque, y compris les modifications non commitées. Cette action est irréversible. La branche et ses commits restent dans le dépôt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its terminals will be closed and its folder will be erased from disk, including uncommitted changes. This can’t be undone. You can keep the branch “%@” and its commits in the repository, or delete it too if it’s merged into the main branch." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the worktree deletion dialog; the variable is the branch name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ses terminaux seront fermés et son dossier sera effacé du disque, y compris les modifications non commitées. Cette action est irréversible. Vous pouvez garder la branche « %@ » et ses commits dans le dépôt, ou la supprimer aussi si elle est fusionnée dans la branche principale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
